=2 Walkthrough
* After the initial cutscene from the **Moon Spiral**, click it again while possessing at least one elemental sap Key Item to receive the option to enter the **Battaru Royale** battlefield.
** {p:Trusts|Trust} can be summoned in this fight (relevant if you're doing it below item level 119.)
* The battle is against 8 {p:Tarutaru} {m:Fomor} mobs, one for each element. (Clone of Boulders, Clone of Torrents, Clone of Gusts, Clone of Flames, Clone of Glaciers, Clone of Sparks, Clone of Lights, Clone of Shadows)
** Each Fomor will cast elemental and {s:enfeebling|Enfeebling} spells of their corresponding element.
** Each Fomor will summon an {p:avatar|Avatar} of their corresponding element when they reach about 50% HP, and the avatar will use its associated {p:Astral Flow} ability before despawing.
** The Fomors have access to all their usual TP abilities.
* Successfully completing the battle will result in the awarding of a {@k} {k:Chocobo key}, which can be redeemed at the {p:Treasure Coffer} in **Tenshodo Headquarters** in {z:Lower Jeuno}.

